{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-238c08c29ddb","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-238c08c29ddb","name":"金针菇汤","category":"soup","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/soup/%E9%87%91%E9%92%88%E8%8F%87%E6%B1%A4.md","blob_sha":"c3a32452b490dd300d181e8fdc2c41928a0bc702","details":{"introduction":"这是一道清淡爽口的家常汤品，口味鲜美，属简易快手菜。金针菇含有丰富的氨基酸和膳食纤维，加鸡蛋还能补充优质蛋白。制作门槛极低，新手也能轻松驾驭，从备菜到出锅大约只需 10 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 金针菇\n- 鸡蛋（如需要）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 金针菇 400-500 克 （市场里面售卖的一袋即可）\n- 食盐 15 克\n- 味精 5 克"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 金针菇徒手掰散，越散越好**不然容易藏牙**，洗净备用。\n2. 用菜刀或者水果刀将上述金针菇段段切，可依据个人喜好，但长度不宜超过 5 cm。\n3. 将金针菇放入锅中，加水没过约食材总高度 1.1 倍，沸腾后**等待 3 分钟**。\n4. 加入味精和食盐并搅拌。\n5. 继续加热约 30 秒，关火装盘。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 如果喜欢在汤里加入鸡蛋，可在步骤 3 中水沸腾之后将打散的鸡蛋液倒入锅中。\n- 出锅后可加入 3-4 滴香油（或者麻油）增香。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：金针菇250g、饮用水800g、大豆食用油8g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）10g、小葱10g、食盐3g；整份约1000g。鲜金针菇完整食用，通用酱油，不加可选品牌调料。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":17.172,"protein_g":0.7647,"carbohydrate_g":2.0752,"fat_g":0.8801},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169382/nutrients","version":"a61e0a6058d098b9","fdc_ids":[169382,173647,171411,174277,170005,173468]},"profile_id":"family-238c08c29ddb-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-238c08c29ddb","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-238c08c29ddb","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-238c08c29ddb-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"enoki","grams":250},{"key":"water","grams":800},{"key":"oil","grams":8},{"ke